## Attorney advertising

This website is attorney advertising for CLINE APC, a California law firm. The responsible attorney is Brian K. Cline, whose office is at 7855 Ivanhoe Avenue, Suite 400, La Jolla, CA 92037.

## Not legal advice

The articles, guides, FAQs and tools on this website provide general information about California law, including the Song-Beverly Consumer Warranty Act. They are not legal advice and are not a substitute for advice from an attorney about your specific situation. Laws change, and how they apply depends on the facts of each case.

## No attorney-client relationship

Reading this website, using the free tools, calling us, or sending us information through a form or email does not create an attorney-client relationship. An attorney-client relationship with CLINE APC exists only after we agree in writing to represent you. Please do not send confidential information until we have confirmed that we can represent you.

## Results, case studies and reviews

Past results do not guarantee or predict a similar outcome in any future matter. Case studies and dollar amounts labelled as representative or composite are illustrations built from common outcomes, not the results of a specific client. Client reviews reflect the experience of the individual reviewer.

## Free tools and estimates

The eligibility checker, buyback calculator and documentation checklist produce educational estimates only. They run in your browser, and the figures they show are not a guarantee of eligibility or recovery. Nothing you enter is sent to CLINE APC unless you choose to submit a case review.

